id: pm-review-kucs
title: "Daily release never publishes: npm reads release-artifact/package.tgz as a GitHub repository"
description: "The release job runs npm publish release-artifact/package.tgz. npm parses a bare dir/file.tgz spec as the GitHub shorthand owner/repo and runs git ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-artifact/package.tgz.git, which fails with Permission denied (publickey); after 3 attempts the job reports that nothing was published. Latest release run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/40667460413 (failure). Fix: publish ./release-artifact/package.tgz so npm reads the verified local archive."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[3]: ci,npm,release
created_at: "2026-10-28T15:21:39.183Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-14T12:05:52.888Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-14T12:05:52.882Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-28T15:53:04.000Z"
author: claude-hub
acceptance_criteria: release.yml publishes ./release-artifact/package.tgz; no other npm or bun command passes a bare relative tarball path; the next daily release publishes to npm with provenance
severity: high
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/59 (merge 5b185952576e, head d8480c4bd453)"
expected_result: release.yml publishes ./release-artifact/package.tgz; no other npm or bun command passes a bare relative tarball path; the next daily release publishes to npm with provenance
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-10-28T15:53:04Z; required checks satisfied; successful head checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Sourcery review, codeql, test (22), test (26)"
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T15:21:40.498Z",claude-hub,"Evidence: the failed release job log shows 'npm error command git --no-replace-objects ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-artifact/package.tgz.git' and 'git@github.com: Permission denied (publickey)' on each of the 3 attempts (same failure in pm-evidence, pm-hypothesis, pm-jev, pm-lint, pm-memory, pm-review, pm-rlm and pm-swarm, which all carry the scaffold line). The other uses of release-artifact/package.tgz in release.yml are shell arguments (mv, sha256sum, openssl), not npm package specs. Fleet tracking: unbraind/pm-cli-companion item pm-cli-website-l9y4."
